-%20%E3%80%8B%20108%20-di-yi-bai-ling-ba-zhang-%20-ge-kong-bo-yi-er.html</link><description>我带着阿迪来到一栋不起眼的写字楼，这里的位置不算好，甚至有些偏，但胜在安静。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20108%20-di-yi-bai-ling-ba-zhang-%20-ge-kong-bo-yi-er.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 06:19:39 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》 107 第一百零七章 隔空博弈一</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20107%20-di-yi-bai-ling-qi-zhang-%20-ge-kong-bo-yi-yi.html</link><description>我手里已经有了两张牌。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20107%20-di-yi-bai-ling-qi-zhang-%20-ge-kong-bo-yi-yi.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 06:13:06 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》 106 第一百零六章 价值转移</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20106%20-di-yi-bai-ling-liu-zhang-%20-jia-zhi-zhuan-yi.html</link><description>天亮的时候，我还没有睡着。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20106%20-di-yi-bai-ling-liu-zhang-%20-jia-zhi-zhuan-yi.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:07:59 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》 105 第一百零五章 可怜之人</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20105%20-di-yi-bai-ling-wu-zhang-%20-ke-lian-zhi-ren.html</link><description>我妈生前，把大舅的电话留给了我。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20105%20-di-yi-bai-ling-wu-zhang-%20-ke-lian-zhi-ren.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 03:13:56 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》 104 第一百零四章 我们回家</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20104%20-di-yi-bai-ling-si-zhang-%20-wo-men-hui-jia.html</link><description>化疗一共安排了六个疗程，用了半年的时间完成。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20104%20-di-yi-bai-ling-si-zhang-%20-wo-men-hui-jia.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 03:12:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》 103 第一百零三章 复杂的关系</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20103%20-di-yi-bai-ling-san-zhang-%20-fu-za-de-guan-xi.html</link><description>文件发过去没过半小时，健哥的电话就打了过来。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20103%20-di-yi-bai-ling-san-zhang-%20-fu-za-de-guan-xi.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 03:11:56 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》 102 第一百零二章 新的连接</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20102%20-di-yi-bai-ling-er-zhang-%20-xin-de-lian-jie.html</link><description>在医院的那段时间，我经常想，为什么自己会突然出现胸口发闷、手臂发麻的感觉，可检查结果却没有发现明显异常。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20102%20-di-yi-bai-ling-er-zhang-%20-xin-de-lian-jie.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 03:11:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》 101 第一百零一章 开始改变</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20101%20-di-yi-bai-ling-yi-zhang-%20-kai-shi-gai-bian.html</link><description>后来很多年，我偶尔还会想起那张贴在墙上的纸条。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20101%20-di-yi-bai-ling-yi-zhang-%20-kai-shi-gai-bian.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 03:10:58 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》 100 第一百章 最后的依靠</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20100%20-di-yi-bai-zhang-%20-zui-hou-de-yi-kao.html</link><description>住院化疗那段时间，家里还发生过一件让我印象很深的事情。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20100%20-di-yi-bai-zhang-%20-zui-hou-de-yi-kao.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 03:10:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》 099 第九十九章 人群之外</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20099%20-di-jiu-shi-jiu-zhang-%20-ren-qun-zhi-wai.html</link><description>我妈住院化疗那段时间，之前买的带地下室商品房已经建好了，拿到钥匙以后，我才发现地下室防水出现了问题。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20099%20-di-jiu-shi-jiu-zhang-%20-ren-qun-zhi-wai.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 03:09:07 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》 098 第九十八章 失去的保障</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20098%20-di-jiu-shi-ba-zhang-%20-shi-qu-de-bao-zhang.html</link><description>回到家以后，我妈问过我，医生到底怎么说。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20098%20-di-jiu-shi-ba-zhang-%20-shi-qu-de-bao-zhang.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 15:00:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》 097 第九十七章 最后的时间</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20097%20-di-jiu-shi-qi-zhang-%20-zui-hou-de-shi-jian.html</link><description>那段时间，我所有的注意力都放在校园推广、数据和合作上。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20097%20-di-jiu-shi-qi-zhang-%20-zui-hou-de-shi-jian.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 14:52:58 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》 096 第九十六章 桌子的边缘</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20096%20-di-jiu-shi-liu-zhang-%20-zhuo-zi-de-bian-yuan.html</link><description>几天后，两家公司终于给出了具体方案。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20096%20-di-jiu-shi-liu-zhang-%20-zhuo-zi-de-bian-yuan.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 14:48:59 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》 095 第九十五章 半份筹码</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20095%20-di-jiu-shi-wu-zhang-%20-ban-fen-chou-ma.html</link><description>在真正谈合作分成之前，我把数据分成二份发给了二家公司负责人，一周多过去了，那几天，我在脑子里反复推演过无数遍后续的场景。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20095%20-di-jiu-shi-wu-zhang-%20-ban-fen-chou-ma.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 06:18:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》 094 第九十四章 我的地盘</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20094%20-di-jiu-shi-si-zhang-%20-wo-de-di-pan.html</link><description>在真正谈合作分成之前，我先把手里攒下来的那批校园用户贷款意向数据，分成两份，分别发给了两家民营公司的负责人。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20094%20-di-jiu-shi-si-zhang-%20-wo-de-di-pan.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 16:25:39 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》 093 第九十三章 圈层之门</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20093%20-di-jiu-shi-san-zhang-%20-quan-ceng-zhi-men.html</link><description>那个时候，校园金融并不是一个完全不存在的市场。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20093%20-di-jiu-shi-san-zhang-%20-quan-ceng-zhi-men.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 06:32:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》 092 第九十二章 入口之外</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20092%20-di-jiu-shi-er-zhang-%20-ru-kou-zhi-wai.html</link><description>长腿女孩就这样消失了。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20092%20-di-jiu-shi-er-zhang-%20-ru-kou-zhi-wai.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 15:08:30 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》091 第九十一章 信息之刃</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B091%20-di-jiu-shi-yi-zhang-%20-xin-xi-zhi-ren.html</link><description>几天后，我再次调出玉罗刹小区门口的监控。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B091%20-di-jiu-shi-yi-zhang-%20-xin-xi-zhi-ren.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 22 Aug 2025 14:33:52 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》090 第九十章 欲望成局</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B090%20-di-jiu-shi-zhang-%20-yu-wang-cheng-ju.html</link><description>正当我沉浸在对目标心理的分析里，电脑屏幕的“蛛网”监控界面闪了一下。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B090%20-di-jiu-shi-zhang-%20-yu-wang-cheng-ju.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 20 Aug 2025 16:08:05 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》089 第八十九章 灰色入口</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B089%20-di-ba-shi-jiu-zhang-%20-hui-se-ru-kou.html</link><description>大雄的网吧开业，我随手塞了五千进红包，装作路过递给他。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B089%20-di-ba-shi-jiu-zhang-%20-hui-se-ru-kou.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 18 Aug 2025 07:33:35 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》088 第八十八章 暗流改道</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B088%20-di-ba-shi-ba-zhang-%20-an-liu-gai-dao.html</link><description>我盯着那份下载一部分的贷款公司文件夹，脑中迅速盘算：这些年轻女孩的需求，是玉罗刹源源不断榨取价值的根本——也是她计划中最脆弱的一环。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B088%20-di-ba-shi-ba-zhang-%20-an-liu-gai-dao.html</guid><pubDate>Sun, 17 Aug 2025 14:18:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》087 第八十七章 留下的痕迹</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B087%20-di-ba-shi-qi-zhang-%20-liu-xia-de-hen-ji.html</link><description>我心里暗暗计算着长腿女孩退租的日期。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B087%20-di-ba-shi-qi-zhang-%20-liu-xia-de-hen-ji.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 16 Aug 2025 16:22:02 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》086 第八十六章 松开的手</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B086%20-di-ba-shi-liu-zhang-%20-song-kai-de-shou.html</link><description>我继续深入挖掘目标电脑里的数据——先把数据抓回来，再慢慢分析研究。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B086%20-di-ba-shi-liu-zhang-%20-song-kai-de-shou.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 15 Aug 2025 04:52:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》085 第八十五章 捷径之门</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B085%20-di-ba-shi-wu-zhang-%20-jie-jing-zhi-men.html</link><description>过了几天，我又去玉罗刹那家大酒店门口瞧了眼。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B085%20-di-ba-shi-wu-zhang-%20-jie-jing-zhi-men.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 14 Aug 2025 14:07:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》084 第八十四章 裂石破局</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B084%20-di-ba-shi-si-zhang-%20-lie-shi-po-ju.html</link><description>长腿女孩的任务几乎已经完成，只差最后的收尾。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B084%20-di-ba-shi-si-zhang-%20-lie-shi-po-ju.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 13 Aug 2025 17:56:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》083 第八十三章 渐入深局</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B083%20-di-ba-shi-san-zhang-%20-jian-ru-shen-ju.html</link><description>那天我们就聊到这儿，像两个人在牌桌上摁住了手里的牌，谁也不亮，谁也不走。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B083%20-di-ba-shi-san-zhang-%20-jian-ru-shen-ju.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 13 Aug 2025 14:36:40 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》082 第八十二章 各行其路</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B082%20-di-ba-shi-er-zhang-%20-ge-xing-qi-lu.html</link><description>情绪正往下坠的时候，许久未见的好兄弟大龙打来电话，说在江边办烧烤派对，叫我过去散散心。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B082%20-di-ba-shi-er-zhang-%20-ge-xing-qi-lu.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 12 Aug 2025 02:33:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》081 第八十一章 裂隙渐深</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B081%20-di-ba-shi-yi-zhang-%20-lie-xi-jian-shen.html</link><description>半个月的筛选，我从网吧二百多人的杂沓里挑出十五个符合条件的人，但真正有兴趣做事、愿意赚钱的，只有八个。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B081%20-di-ba-shi-yi-zhang-%20-lie-xi-jian-shen.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 11 Aug 2025 14:26:40 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》080 第八十章 另寻蹊径</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B080%20-di-ba-shi-zhang-%20-ling-xun-xi-jing.html</link><description>未雨绸缪是我的习惯，眼下的紧要任务，是找到那种拿钱办事、不问是非的人。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B080%20-di-ba-shi-zhang-%20-ling-xun-xi-jing.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 09 Aug 2025 18:00:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》079 第七十九章 裂缝初现</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B079%20-di-qi-shi-jiu-zhang-%20-lie-feng-chu-xian.html</link><description>长腿女孩告诉我，她通过了科目二。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B079%20-di-qi-shi-jiu-zhang-%20-lie-feng-chu-xian.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 09 Aug 2025 13:39:37 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》078 第七十八章 价值沉没</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B078%20-di-qi-shi-ba-zhang-%20-jia-zhi-chen-mei.html</link><description>这些，是我从妈那里听来的。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B078%20-di-qi-shi-ba-zhang-%20-jia-zhi-chen-mei.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 09 Aug 2025 06:19:47 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》077 第七十七章 蓄而未发</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B077%20-di-qi-shi-qi-zhang-%20-xu-er-wei-fa.html</link><description>我告诉她要拍些照片，作为后面计划里的素材，她欣然答应。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B077%20-di-qi-shi-qi-zhang-%20-xu-er-wei-fa.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 08 Aug 2025 15:20:59 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》076 第七十六章 暗线成网</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B076%20-di-qi-shi-liu-zhang-%20-an-xian-cheng-wang.html</link><description>长腿女孩觉得来酒店是浪费，我没多说什么——在我心里，她一直是个节约的人。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B076%20-di-qi-shi-liu-zhang-%20-an-xian-cheng-wang.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 07 Aug 2025 14:48:48 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》075 第七十五章 初得其法</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B075%20-di-qi-shi-wu-zhang-%20-chu-de-qi-fa.html</link><description>长腿女孩说房子租好了，驾校也报了，正刷题等着考科一。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B075%20-di-qi-shi-wu-zhang-%20-chu-de-qi-fa.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 06 Aug 2025 16:24:26 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》074 第七十四章 反复打磨</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B074%20-di-qi-shi-si-zhang-%20-fan-fu-da-mo.html</link><description>长腿女孩把椅子拉到床前坐下，低头沉吟，声音轻柔又带着几分不确定：“我有点好奇……那个你说的对手，到底是什么样的人？我……真的能做到，吸引他吗？”我沉默了几秒，盯着她的眼睛慢慢说：“他那种人，心思重、警觉性高。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B074%20-di-qi-shi-si-zhang-%20-fan-fu-da-mo.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 05 Aug 2025 18:44:52 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》073 第七十三章 悄然成形</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B073%20-di-qi-shi-san-zhang-%20-qiao-ran-cheng-xing.html</link><description>这几天我把精力都放在长腿女孩身上，二哥打过几次电话叫我出去玩，我都推掉了。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B073%20-di-qi-shi-san-zhang-%20-qiao-ran-cheng-xing.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 05 Aug 2025 14:01:40 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》072 第七十二章 一颗钉子</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B072%20-di-qi-shi-er-zhang-%20-yi-ke-ding-zi.html</link><description>次日，我去她那间藏在小巷尽头的小旅店接她，一起打车往师范大学的方向去。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B072%20-di-qi-shi-er-zhang-%20-yi-ke-ding-zi.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 04 Aug 2025 13:39:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》071 第七十一章 试人见心</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B071%20-di-qi-shi-yi-zhang-%20-shi-ren-jian-xin.html</link><description>我回去一看，二哥和晓雨还腻歪着，小露却不见了。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B071%20-di-qi-shi-yi-zhang-%20-shi-ren-jian-xin.html</guid><pubDate>Sun, 03 Aug 2025 16:01:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》070 第七十章 局中的人</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B070%20-di-qi-shi-zhang-%20-ju-zhong-de-ren.html</link><description>二哥看我最近每次都换不同的场子，他问我到底喜欢什么样的妞。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B070%20-di-qi-shi-zhang-%20-ju-zhong-de-ren.html</guid><pubDate>Sun, 03 Aug 2025 08:46:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》069 第六十九章 陷入泥潭</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B069%20-di-liu-shi-jiu-zhang-%20-xian-ru-ni-tan.html</link><description>二哥约我出来吃饭，顺口问：“你最近是不是老去那家KTV？”他语气随意，像闲聊，但这句试探像根羽毛，轻轻搔在我神经末梢。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B069%20-di-liu-shi-jiu-zhang-%20-xian-ru-ni-tan.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 02 Aug 2025 19:06:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》068 第六十八章 以身入局</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B068%20-di-liu-shi-ba-zhang-%20-yi-shen-ru-ju.html</link><description>我近期的任务只有两个：一是挑一颗能用的钉子——这人肯定不能从玉罗刹的地盘里找；二是去玉罗刹旗下的几个场子转一圈，先踩踩水。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B068%20-di-liu-shi-ba-zhang-%20-yi-shen-ru-ju.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 02 Aug 2025 13:56:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》067 第六十七章 寻找新钉子</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B067%20-di-liu-shi-qi-zhang-%20-xun-zhao-xin-ding-zi.html</link><description>为那颗迟迟落不下的“钉子”烦闷着，思绪正绕着死结打圈，手机忽然响了。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B067%20-di-liu-shi-qi-zhang-%20-xun-zhao-xin-ding-zi.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 01 Aug 2025 17:15:48 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》066 第六十六章 借势破局</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B066%20-di-liu-shi-liu-zhang-%20-jie-shi-po-ju.html</link><description>我做日元和黄金的交易，不是看它们稳，是看它们疯。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B066%20-di-liu-shi-liu-zhang-%20-jie-shi-po-ju.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 01 Aug 2025 15:50:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》065 第六十五章 多重视角</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B065%20-di-liu-shi-wu-zhang-%20-duo-zhong-shi-jiao.html</link><description>网站这块，自打跟风哥搭上线，广告收益翻了好几倍，租的国外服务器也悄悄涨到五台，像藤蔓一样，无声地爬上了墙头。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B065%20-di-liu-shi-wu-zhang-%20-duo-zhong-shi-jiao.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 30 Jul 2025 14:38:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》064 第六十四章 抓到线头</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B064%20-di-liu-shi-si-zhang-%20-zhua-dao-xian-tou.html</link><description>日子久了，我心头那点疑虑非但没消，反倒像生了根。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B064%20-di-liu-shi-si-zhang-%20-zhua-dao-xian-tou.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 29 Jul 2025 14:23:39 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》063 第六十三章 看不见的线</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B063%20-di-liu-shi-san-zhang-%20-kan-bu-jian-de-xian.html</link><description>玉罗刹的身份，本身就是一道天然枷锁，死死拴住我。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B063%20-di-liu-shi-san-zhang-%20-kan-bu-jian-de-xian.html</guid><pubDate>Sun, 27 Jul 2025 17:04:35 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》062 第六十二章 老树之下</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B062%20-di-liu-shi-er-zhang-%20-lao-shu-zhi-xia.html</link><description>玉罗刹的底气，从来都不是她自己。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B062%20-di-liu-shi-er-zhang-%20-lao-shu-zhi-xia.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 25 Jul 2025 16:49:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》061 第六十一章 看不见的手</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B061%20-di-liu-shi-yi-zhang-%20-kan-bu-jian-de-shou.html</link><description>玉罗刹最让我看不透的地方，是她很少亲自站到台前。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B061%20-di-liu-shi-yi-zhang-%20-kan-bu-jian-de-shou.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 23 Jul 2025 14:23:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》060 第六十章 更高一层</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B060%20-di-liu-shi-zhang-%20-geng-gao-yi-ceng.html</link><description>到夜深人静，我就盯着健哥那摞资料出神。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B060%20-di-liu-shi-zhang-%20-geng-gao-yi-ceng.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 22 Jul 2025 14:59:36 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》059 第五十九章 我的选择</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B059%20-di-wu-shi-jiu-zhang-%20-wo-de-xuan-ze.html</link><description>录取通知书上的“商大工管”四个黑字，我盯了很久。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B059%20-di-wu-shi-jiu-zhang-%20-wo-de-xuan-ze.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 21 Jul 2025 13:27:40 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》058 第五十八章 替你决定</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B058%20-di-wu-shi-ba-zhang-%20-ti-ni-jue-ding.html</link><description>我，一个极度自卑又自以为理性的人，背着过去留下的伤痕，行走在锋利如刀的边缘。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B058%20-di-wu-shi-ba-zhang-%20-ti-ni-jue-ding.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 14 Jul 2025 14:58:39 +0000</pubDate></item><item>