</guid><pubDate>Thu, 10 Jul 2025 17:49:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》052 第五十二章 隔着别人</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B052%20-di-wu-shi-er-zhang-%20-ge-zhao-bie-ren.html</link><description>成也萧何，困也萧何。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B052%20-di-wu-shi-er-zhang-%20-ge-zhao-bie-ren.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 10 Jul 2025 14:33:52 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》051 第五十一章 光的方向</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B051%20-di-wu-shi-yi-zhang-%20-guang-de-fang-xiang.html</link><description>陈溪生日那天放学，我咬着牙，鼓着劲儿，把那盒心型巧克力塞给了她。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B051%20-di-wu-shi-yi-zhang-%20-guang-de-fang-xiang.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 10 Jul 2025 06:24:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》050 第五十章 钓鱼的含义</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B050%20-di-wu-shi-zhang-%20-diao-yu-de-han-yi.html</link><description>钓鱼女孩和“城府女孩”是死党，这事儿，按理说挺让人摸不着头脑的，可细想想，也不算怪事。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B050%20-di-wu-shi-zhang-%20-diao-yu-de-han-yi.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 10 Jul 2025 02:00:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》048 第四十九章 第一面镜子</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B048%20-di-si-shi-jiu-zhang-%20-di-yi-mian-jing-zi.html</link><description>网线捞钱这条路，走着走着就看明白了——做中文站啊，跟熬粥差不多，忙得汗流浃背，熬出来一锅寡淡的水。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B048%20-di-si-shi-jiu-zhang-%20-di-yi-mian-jing-zi.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 09 Jul 2025 17:00:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》048 第四十八章 没有鞘的刀</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B048%20-di-si-shi-ba-zhang-%20-mei-you-qiao-de-dao.html</link><description>开学前一天，我去瞧了眼。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B048%20-di-si-shi-ba-zhang-%20-mei-you-qiao-de-dao.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 09 Jul 2025 14:34:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》047 第四十七章 同一张桌子</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B047%20-di-si-shi-qi-zhang-%20-tong-yi-zhang-zhuo-zi.html</link><description>初中那阵子，我还是一副老实巴交的模样。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B047%20-di-si-shi-qi-zhang-%20-tong-yi-zhang-zhuo-zi.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 09 Jul 2025 08:19:55 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》046 第四十六章 站在一边</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B046%20-di-si-shi-liu-zhang-%20-zhan-zai-yi-bian.html</link><description>我晃到阿迪家酒馆门口，铺子早关了，里头那盏小灯还亮着，昏黄着，像条半睁眼的蛇，眯着眼盯着街口，冷不丁让人起一身鸡皮疙瘩。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B046%20-di-si-shi-liu-zhang-%20-zhan-zai-yi-bian.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 09 Jul 2025 06:48:33 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》045 第四十五章 桌下的东西</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B045%20-di-si-shi-wu-zhang-%20-zhuo-xia-de-dong-xi.html</link><description>这钱一撒出去，哪儿是了事？做买卖这碗饭，呛得下第一口，还得撑得住后头那几勺。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B045%20-di-si-shi-wu-zhang-%20-zhuo-xia-de-dong-xi.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 08 Jul 2025 18:09:52 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》044 第四十四章 账外的筹码</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B044%20-di-si-shi-si-zhang-%20-zhang-wai-de-chou-ma.html</link><description>至于这摊子该落哪儿，说实话——在我琢磨着埋小川子这颗钉子的那天，心里就有了盘算。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B044%20-di-si-shi-si-zhang-%20-zhang-wai-de-chou-ma.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 08 Jul 2025 16:33:52 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》043 第四十三章 摸索前行</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B043%20-di-si-shi-san-zhang-%20-mo-suo-qian-xing.html</link><description>直到运动会那天，我才真刮了小亮那小子一眼。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B043%20-di-si-shi-san-zhang-%20-mo-suo-qian-xing.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 08 Jul 2025 14:27:58 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》 042 第四十二章 理所当然</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20042%20-di-si-shi-er-zhang-%20-li-suo-dang-ran.html</link><description>阿洋稀罕小飞，小飞也知道我对她没那个意思，干脆认我当了哥。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20042%20-di-si-shi-er-zhang-%20-li-suo-dang-ran.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 08 Jul 2025 13:33:58 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》 041 第四十一章 歪打正着</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20041%20-di-si-shi-yi-zhang-%20-wai-da-zheng-zhao.html</link><description>这学校里，不少老面孔，小学、初中的那帮同学，又凑一块儿了，日子也还算安稳。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20041%20-di-si-shi-yi-zhang-%20-wai-da-zheng-zhao.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 07 Jul 2025 18:10:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》040 第四十章 没有目的</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B040%20-di-si-shi-zhang-%20-mei-you-mu-de.html</link><description>新学期刚探了个头，我的好日子就跟着咽了气。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B040%20-di-si-shi-zhang-%20-mei-you-mu-de.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 07 Jul 2025 17:04:59 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》039 第三十九章 连接点</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B039%20-di-san-shi-jiu-zhang-%20-lian-jie-dian.html</link><description>开学前几天，大壮打电话约我出去打台球。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B039%20-di-san-shi-jiu-zhang-%20-lian-jie-dian.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 07 Jul 2025 15:49:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》038 第三十八章 临界点</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B038%20-di-san-shi-ba-zhang-%20-lin-jie-dian.html</link><description>回到家，电脑一掀，我就搜开了“勾兑”这行当。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B038%20-di-san-shi-ba-zhang-%20-lin-jie-dian.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 07 Jul 2025 11:51:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》037 第三十七章 偏门与捷径</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B037%20-di-san-shi-qi-zhang-%20-pian-men-yu-jie-jing.html</link><description>和阿红断了半年多，那个头像还杵在那儿，像块过期却舍不得丢的糖。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B037%20-di-san-shi-qi-zhang-%20-pian-men-yu-jie-jing.html</guid><pubDate>Sun, 06 Jul 2025 17:43:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》036 第三十六章 意外的美金</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B036%20-di-san-shi-liu-zhang-%20-yi-wai-de-mei-jin.html</link><description>人生有时候冷不丁塞你一颗糖。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B036%20-di-san-shi-liu-zhang-%20-yi-wai-de-mei-jin.html</guid><pubDate>Sun, 06 Jul 2025 15:40:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》035 第三十五章 心的隔阂</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B035%20-di-san-shi-wu-zhang-%20-xin-de-ge-he.html</link><description>高中开学，公交车晃了十几分钟。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B035%20-di-san-shi-wu-zhang-%20-xin-de-ge-he.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 05 Jul 2025 18:24:55 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》034 第三十四章 我听你的</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B034%20-di-san-shi-si-zhang-%20-wo-ting-ni-de.html</link><description>从阿迪家出来，天刚有点暗，我坐公交晃回家。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B034%20-di-san-shi-si-zhang-%20-wo-ting-ni-de.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 05 Jul 2025 04:31:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》033 第三十三章 又一颗钉子</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B033%20-di-san-shi-san-zhang-%20-you-yi-ke-ding-zi.html</link><description>我把那张蚂蚁窝似的配料表，一行行扣下来，在电脑前挨个查——那些冷冰冰的代号，猫腻全藏在用量后头。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B033%20-di-san-shi-san-zhang-%20-you-yi-ke-ding-zi.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 04 Jul 2025 15:21:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》032 第三十二章 钩子的诞生</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B032%20-di-san-shi-er-zhang-%20-gou-zi-de-dan-sheng.html</link><description>日子苦得像吞下碎渣。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B032%20-di-san-shi-er-zhang-%20-gou-zi-de-dan-sheng.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 04 Jul 2025 06:30:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》031 第三十一章 自以为是</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B031%20-di-san-shi-yi-zhang-%20-zi-yi-wei-shi.html</link><description>晴美，是那种一出现就自带光的人。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B031%20-di-san-shi-yi-zhang-%20-zi-yi-wei-shi.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 04 Jul 2025 02:47:58 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》030 第三十章 手里的东西</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B030%20-di-san-shi-zhang-%20-shou-li-de-dong-xi.html</link><description>那点偷来的好日子，短得像截烧剩的烟屁股。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B030%20-di-san-shi-zhang-%20-shou-li-de-dong-xi.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 03 Jul 2025 16:50:10 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》029 第二十九章 瓶中的小鱼</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B029%20-di-er-shi-jiu-zhang-%20-ping-zhong-de-xiao-yu.html</link><description>那个假期，算是我日子缝儿里漏下来的几块快活碎片。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B029%20-di-er-shi-jiu-zhang-%20-ping-zhong-de-xiao-yu.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 03 Jul 2025 16:02:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》028 第二十八章 笨拙的牵手</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B028%20-di-er-shi-ba-zhang-%20-ben-zhuo-de-qian-shou.html</link><description>“圣光女孩”阿红念叨那张五月天专辑，我到底还是钻了邮局的绿门洞，把碟片塞进牛皮纸信封的肚子里。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B028%20-di-er-shi-ba-zhang-%20-ben-zhuo-de-qian-shou.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 03 Jul 2025 13:44:55 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》027 第二十七章 梯子断了</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B027%20-di-er-shi-qi-zhang-%20-ti-zi-duan-le.html</link><description>中考那天？嗨，对我来说跟走个过场戏没啥两样。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B027%20-di-er-shi-qi-zhang-%20-ti-zi-duan-le.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 03 Jul 2025 07:29:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》026 第二十六章 没有答案</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B026%20-di-er-shi-liu-zhang-%20-mei-you-da-an.html</link><description>钱难赚，屎难吃。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B026%20-di-er-shi-liu-zhang-%20-mei-you-da-an.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 03 Jul 2025 02:52:55 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》025 第二十五章 看不见的门</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B025%20-di-er-shi-wu-zhang-%20-kan-bu-jian-de-men.html</link><description>想在这地界儿活出点人样，兜里没钢镚儿？做梦！家里是指望不上了。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B025%20-di-er-shi-wu-zhang-%20-kan-bu-jian-de-men.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 02 Jul 2025 14:46:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》024 第二十四章 桌下的筹码</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B024%20-di-er-shi-si-zhang-%20-zhuo-xia-de-chou-ma.html</link><description>小川子这根线，光靠一百多块钱和一句“哥”，其实根本算不上什么。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B024%20-di-er-shi-si-zhang-%20-zhuo-xia-de-chou-ma.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 02 Jul 2025 08:59:32 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》023 第二十三章 站在台下</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B023%20-di-er-shi-san-zhang-%20-zhan-zai-tai-xia.html</link><description>那天放学，瞅见阿然那孙子又凑在小龙女阿珍边上，俩人脑袋都快挨一块儿了，嘀嘀咕咕，阿珍那笑，甜得齁嗓子。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B023%20-di-er-shi-san-zhang-%20-zhan-zai-tai-xia.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 02 Jul 2025 07:40:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》022 第二十二章 虚假的仰望</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B022%20-di-er-shi-er-zhang-%20-xu-jia-de-yang-wang.html</link><description>午休铃刚敲得人心慌，食堂那点油水寡淡的饭菜，我和大龙嚼蜡似的往下扒拉。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B022%20-di-er-shi-er-zhang-%20-xu-jia-de-yang-wang.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 02 Jul 2025 05:36:26 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》021 第二十一章 那一拳后</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B021%20-di-er-shi-yi-zhang-%20-na-yi-quan-hou.html</link><description>说起来这是我初中干的最蠢的一件事，初三那会阿然和阿瑶是同桌，有一回不知为啥，阿然那巴掌甩在阿瑶脸上时，声音脆得离谱，活脱厚实案板上一刀劈开根顶花带刺的嫩黄瓜，脆响——“啪！”整个教室的空气“唰”一下被抽干了，静得能听见粉笔灰簌簌往下掉的声音。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B021%20-di-er-shi-yi-zhang-%20-na-yi-quan-hou.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 01 Jul 2025 17:52:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》020 第二十章 不一样的人</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B020%20-di-er-shi-zhang-%20-bu-yi-yang-de-ren.html</link><description>回到家里，我盯着抽屉里那颗彩虹玻璃珠发癔症。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B020%20-di-er-shi-zhang-%20-bu-yi-yang-de-ren.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 01 Jul 2025 14:01:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》019 第十九章 那个不一样</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B019%20-di-shi-jiu-zhang-%20-na-ge-bu-yi-yang.html</link><description>破破公交晃晃悠悠挤了一个多钟头，下车时天已经擦黑，像有人把整片天空泼上了一层浓墨。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B019%20-di-shi-jiu-zhang-%20-na-ge-bu-yi-yang.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 01 Jul 2025 13:22:37 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》018 第十八章 那道门后</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B018%20-di-shi-ba-zhang-%20-na-dao-men-hou.html</link><description>这破公交，挤得跟沙丁鱼罐头似的，吭哧吭哧挪了一个多钟头。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B018%20-di-shi-ba-zhang-%20-na-dao-men-hou.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 01 Jul 2025 07:57:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》017 第十七章 旧地无声</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B017%20-di-shi-qi-zhang-%20-jiu-di-wu-sheng.html</link><description>我爷爷坐在藤椅里，眼角的褶子笑开了花，枯瘦的手朝我招着。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B017%20-di-shi-qi-zhang-%20-jiu-di-wu-sheng.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 01 Jul 2025 06:35:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》016 第十六章 灰色的真相</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B016%20-di-shi-liu-zhang-%20-hui-se-de-zhen-xiang.html</link><description>我一直把“卡车那事儿”死死摁在肚子底，一点风声都没往外漏。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B016%20-di-shi-liu-zhang-%20-hui-se-de-zhen-xiang.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 01 Jul 2025 02:49:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》015 第十五章 危险预感</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B015%20-di-shi-wu-zhang-%20-wei-xian-yu-gan.html</link><description>初三那段时间放学挺晚，天跟块没拧干的脏抹布似的，灰沉沉往下坠。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B015%20-di-shi-wu-zhang-%20-wei-xian-yu-gan.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 30 Jun 2025 16:56:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》014 第十四章 旁观之眼</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B014%20-di-shi-si-zhang-%20-pang-guan-zhi-yan.html</link><description>小宇这厮，网吧泡得比咱都疯魔！我那时候也去，不过就是放学以后偶尔过去坐几个钟头，从没在网吧熬过夜。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B014%20-di-shi-si-zhang-%20-pang-guan-zhi-yan.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 30 Jun 2025 15:10:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》013 第十三章 看不见的秤</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B013%20-di-shi-san-zhang-%20-kan-bu-jian-de-cheng.html</link><description>那阵子鼓捣黑客技术也就摸了个皮毛，顶多能在别人面前显摆几下。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B013%20-di-shi-san-zhang-%20-kan-bu-jian-de-cheng.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 30 Jun 2025 11:24:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》012 第十二章 无人撑伞</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B012%20-di-shi-er-zhang-%20-wu-ren-cheng-san.html</link><description>我爸咽气那会儿，偏偏赶了个最“贴心”的日子——礼拜五。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B012%20-di-shi-er-zhang-%20-wu-ren-cheng-san.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 30 Jun 2025 07:54:33 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》011 第十一章 伞落之后</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B011%20-di-shi-yi-zhang-%20-san-luo-zhi-hou.html</link><description>我爸当年捏着酒杯，唾沫横飞，眼睛亮得跟灯泡似的：“三姐夫一句话的事儿！”他那个干地产的三姐夫，正好和负责拆我们铺子的老板酒桌上有来往，划拳猜枚，三杯黄汤下肚，铺子回迁的事儿就跟酒气一样飘在半空——看着虚，但说出来句句铿锵，仿佛那铺子只是借人家擦了擦灰，明天就能风风光光地还回来。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B011%20-di-shi-yi-zhang-%20-san-luo-zhi-hou.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 30 Jun 2025 06:35:30 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》010 第十章 伞下余荫</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B010%20-di-shi-zhang-%20-san-xia-yu-yin.html</link><description>我爸，教育口那旮旯衙门里坐了十几年的老蛤蟆。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B010%20-di-shi-zhang-%20-san-xia-yu-yin.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 30 Jun 2025 05:52:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》009 第九章 无形的筹码</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B009%20-di-jiu-zhang-%20-wu-xing-de-chou-ma.html</link><description>五爷的拳头够硬？屁！ 那老狐狸精着呢！当年道上扑腾的愣头青，哪个不是缺胳膊断腿爬回来的？可你瞅五爷？连他那身油光水滑的中五爷的拳头够硬？屁！ 那老狐狸精着呢！当年在外面闯荡的那些狠角色，哪个不是缺胳膊断腿爬回来的？可你瞅五爷？连他那身油光水滑的中山装，褶子都没多一条！凭啥？这老小子专他妈会“掏心窝子”——不是暖你，是捅你软肋！

甭管多横的茬儿撞他枪口上，人家眼皮子一耷拉，烟屁股往地上一碾，跟拉家常似的：
“哟，老张啊，听说你家那小崽子在某某中学？啧，不巧了，从校长到这片管事的，谁不得卖我老五几分薄面？咋样，需不需要我递个话儿，‘关照关照’你家那小宝贝疙瘩的…嗯？”
“小李子，你媳妇儿？啧啧，长得是真水灵！可你看我这帮兄弟，一个个饿狼似的，咱儿丑话可没说在前头啊…到时候他们要管不住自个儿裤裆里那玩意儿，嘿嘿……”

操！话没落地呢，对面那位爷后脊梁的冷汗都能洗澡了！这他妈哪是谈判？这就是一根指头，稳准狠，直插你心口死穴！杀人？连血丝儿都瞧不见！阴，真他妈阴！可江湖这口大染缸，偏就泡着些不信邪、油盐不进的生瓜蛋子。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B009%20-di-jiu-zhang-%20-wu-xing-de-chou-ma.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 30 Jun 2025 02:57:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》008 第八章 无声的安排</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B008%20-di-ba-zhang-%20-wu-sheng-de-an-pai.html</link><description>昨晚，我妈下班回来。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B008%20-di-ba-zhang-%20-wu-sheng-de-an-pai.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 30 Jun 2025 02:24:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》 007 第七章 未熄的火种</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20007%20-di-qi-zhang-%20-wei-xi-de-huo-zhong.html</link><description>在学校哥们儿我活得跟阴沟里刚断奶的耗子崽子似的，缩在壳里，放个屁都得憋成哑炮。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B%20007%20-di-qi-zhang-%20-wei-xi-de-huo-zhong.html</guid><pubDate>Sun, 29 Jun 2025 15:38:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》006 第六章 网里的光</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B006%20-di-liu-zhang-%20-wang-li-de-guang.html</link><description>我家离那破学校，远得跟他妈西天取经似的！每天在公交车上摇摇晃晃一个多钟头，骨头架子都快散黄儿了。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B006%20-di-liu-zhang-%20-wang-li-de-guang.html</guid><pubDate>Sun, 29 Jun 2025 13:49:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》005 第五章 第一张网</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B005%20-di-wu-zhang-%20-di-yi-zhang-wang.html</link><description>初一那年，家里买了台联想大屁股电脑，嘿，我那图书馆生涯算是彻底喂了狗！打那天起，老子就跟那发光的方盒子杠上了。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B005%20-di-wu-zhang-%20-di-yi-zhang-wang.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Jun 2025 17:01:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》004 第四章 灯下的黑暗</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B004%20-di-si-zhang-%20-deng-xia-de-hei-an.html</link><description>初中那会儿，脑子一热，真把自己当令狐冲转世了。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B004%20-di-si-zhang-%20-deng-xia-de-hei-an.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Jun 2025 15:08:37 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》003 第三章 光暗之间</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B003%20-di-san-zhang-%20-guang-an-zhi-jian.html</link><description>除了被摁在学校那个大号笼子里，我他妈就剩一个爱好了——看书。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B003%20-di-san-zhang-%20-guang-an-zhi-jian.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Jun 2025 14:08:14 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》002 第二章 借来的力量</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B002%20-di-er-zhang-%20-jie-lai-de-li-liang.html</link><description>初中那会儿，日子寡淡得像涮锅水。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B002%20-di-er-zhang-%20-jie-lai-de-li-liang.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Jun 2025 08:14:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《跃渊 》001 第一章 规则启蒙</title><link>https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B001%20-di-yi-zhang-%20-gui-ze-qi-meng.html</link><description>您即将踏入的，是一座由现实与隐喻共同搭建的镜中之城。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://bentaoan.github.io/post/%E3%80%8A-yue-yuan-%20%E3%80%8B001%20-di-yi-zhang-%20-gui-ze-qi-meng.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Jun 2025 16:45:42 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>